 # Changelog
 
+## 1.3.0
+- Added `scheduledAt` to `messages.send()` to send up to 72 hours later.
+- Added `messages.cancel()` to cancel a scheduled message.
+
 ## 1.2.0
 - Added `tags` to `messages.send()`.
 
